you can ignore/drop the samples that have NA covariate value or try to impute the covariate values (don't know how in your specific case). The covariates are the same for all samples, and provided once to the function, you simply drop the samples in methylBase object whose covariates are NA. You can try to use reorganize() function to drop samples

